          "kicker": "Coaching talks",
          "heading": "Warren Gatland says he chose not to apply for Fiji job",
          "body": "Former Wales head coach Warren Gatland says he spoke with Fiji about the role before deciding not to apply, with Jake White now in the job ahead of next year's World Cup. Gatland, who also declined a Harlequins offer earlier in the year on timing, has a verdict on the appointment: \"Jake White will do a good job.\" Fiji's first Test under White is Saturday against Japan."
        },
