      "edition": "Friday 23 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection bid",
          "heading": "Northampton back George Hendy says he is serious about an England call-up",
          "body": "Northampton back George Hendy is pressing his claims for England, saying he would take a spot on the wing or at 15 if it gets him into the squad. \"I just want to throw my hat in the ring for England and I'm really quite serious about that,\" the 24-year-old told BBC Sport. He has scored 44 tries in 80 games for Northampton, and England boss Steve Borthwick names a training squad on Sunday for the November Nations Championship matches against Australia, Japan and New Zealand in London."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
