          "kicker": "Recent form",
          "heading": "Italy average 28.9 points conceded across their last 11 games",
          "body": "Across their last 11 games, Italy have scored 190 points, an average of 17.3 a game. Across the same stretch they have conceded 318, an average of 28.9. Their best result in that window was a 34-19 home win over Chile in November 2025, in International Friendlies. Their next fixture is South Africa in the Nations Championship, the reigning world champions."
        },
        {
