          "kicker": "Milestone cap",
          "heading": "Wales women's Alex Callender to win 50th cap against Japan Saturday",
          "body": "Wales women's flanker Alex Callender will win her 50th cap in Saturday's WXV Global Series game against Japan. Callender, who won her first cap in 2019, is co-captain with Kate Williams and has returned from injuries suffered before, during and after the 2025 World Cup. Sisters Nel and Branwen Metcalfe also start their first Test together. Lynn said: \"Whenever she puts that jersey on she wears it with pride and wants to represent the nation.\""
        },
