          "heading": "Argentina's biggest win in their last 11 games: 52-28 over Wales",
          "body": "Argentina's biggest win across their last 11 games was a 52-28 away victory over Wales in November 2025, filed under International Friendlies, and it is the win that stands out in that window. Their most recent result was a 28-28 draw with Australia. The Pumas take that Wales scoreline into their next fixture, Ireland v Argentina in Round 4 of the Nations Championship."
