      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Women's XV selection",
          "heading": "Japan women's XV start Savannah Bodman and Sophie Akiko Langford against Wales",
          "body": "Japan's women's XV open the first of two WXV Global Series Tests against Wales on Saturday with Savannah Bodman at number 8 and Sophie Akiko Langford at outside centre. Head coach Toshizumi Kitagawa, whose tenure has included losses to Fiji, Italy and twice to Ireland, has picked a squad willing to blood new players. Wales lead the head-to-head 2-0, including a 19-10 win at WXV2 in 2024."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
