        {
          "kicker": "Women's Test",
          "heading": "Springbok Women brace for physical Ireland test after inconsistent WXV",
          "body": "South Africa's women host Ireland in the first of two WXV Global Series Tests this weekend, and Ireland captain Erin King expects the physical battle to decide it. The Springbok Women have been inconsistent, with wins over Spain and Italy offset by a heavy defeat to Wales, while Ireland opened with a loss to the USA. King says Ireland \"definitely don't shy away from\" the physicality, and it is Ireland's first women's Test on Springbok soil."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "France recall Gregory Alldritt for November Nations Championship matches",
